docs {
  ## Server cancel

  Cancel a pending shutdown or restart timer.

  - Method and path: `POST /api/v1/server/control`.
  - Body: `action` is `cancel`. `delaySeconds` is optional and unused for cancel.
  - Write gate: `GmApi.AllowWrites = 1`.
  - Server-control gate: `GmApi.AllowServerControl = 1`; the default is `0`, so this returns
    `403 server_control_disabled` until the config is enabled.
  - Permission: `RBAC_PERM_COMMAND_SERVER_SHUTDOWN_CANCEL` (735).
  - Actor: signed `X-GM-Actor` game account id; must have security above `SEC_PLAYER`.
  - Success: `200` with `{"status":"ok"}`. Audit rows: `pending` then `success`.
  - Failure: `400 bad_request`, `403 server_control_disabled` or `forbidden`,
    `500 audit_failed`, `503 world_unavailable`.

  Shutdown and restart use the same path with `delaySeconds` 1-3600; a restart only exits the
  process and needs an external supervisor to come back.
}
